# Recipe Extraction & Web Scraping Service

This document explains how to integrate the Recipe Extraction & Web Scraping Service (hosted on Render) with your Expo application for production use.

## Overview

The Recipe Extraction & Web Scraping Service is a comprehensive backend API that provides:

- 🍽️ **Instagram Recipe Extraction** - Extract recipes and content from Instagram posts
- 🕸️ **General Web Scraping** - Extract content from any website using industry-standard libraries
- 🚀 **High Performance** - Built with robust libraries and caching
- 🛡️ **Anti-Detection** - Browser-like headers and rate limiting
- 📊 **Rich Data Extraction** - Text, links, images, metadata, forms, tables

This service is hosted on Render and can be integrated into your Expo application.

## Base URL

```
https://recipeextractionservice.onrender.com
```

## API Endpoints

### 1. Health Check

- **Endpoint**: `/health`
- **Method**: GET
- **Purpose**: Verify service availability
- **Response**: `{ "status": "ok" }`

### 2. Server Status

- **Endpoint**: `/api/status`
- **Method**: GET
- **Purpose**: Get detailed server status and configuration
- **Response**: Server configuration and status information

### 3. Extract Instagram Recipe

- **Endpoint**: `/api/extract`
- **Method**: POST
- **Body**: `{ "url": "instagram_post_url" }`
- **Response**: Recipe data including ingredients, instructions, and media

**Example Response:**

```json
{
  "shortcode": "SHORTCODE",
  "caption": "Post caption text...",
  "username": "post_author",
  "media": [
    {
      "url": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
      "type": "image"
    }
  ],
  "likes": 123456,
  "timestamp": "2023-04-01T12:34:56",
  "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/SHORTCODE/"
}
```

### 🆕 4. Web Scraping (Real Content Extraction)

- **Endpoint**: `/api/scrape-web`
- **Method**: POST
- **Purpose**: Extract real content from any website using BeautifulSoup + Requests
- **Body**:

```json
{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "options": {
    "text": true,
    "links": true,
    "images": true,
    "metadata": true,
    "headings": true,
    "tables": false,
    "forms": false
  }
}
```

**Response Features:**

- Page title and metadata (Open Graph, Twitter Cards)
- Full text content with word count
- All links (internal/external classification)
- Images with alt text and dimensions
- Headings (H1-H6) with hierarchy
- Optional: Table data and form structures

